<title>BRAZIL: Brazil's Caemi H1 loss shrinks vs yr ago.</title>
<headline>Brazil's Caemi H1 loss shrinks vs yr ago.</headline>
<dateline>SAO PAULO 1997-08-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Brazilian mining conglomerate Caemi Mineracao e Metalurgica S.A. on Thursday reported the following first-half 1997 financial results.</p>
<p>		    Jan-June 1997	   Jan-June 1996</p>
<p>    Loss		  11.31 million	   26.54 million</p>
<p>    Shr Loss	    2.89 reais		11.29 reais</p>
<p>    Oper Loss	   8.02 million	    26.75 million</p>
<p>    Pre-tax Loss	11.31 million	   26.77 million</p>
<p>    Net Sales	  281.95 million	   N/A</p>
<p>Note: Figures are in Brazilian reais and are not adjusted for inflation. Share loss is per 1,000 shares.</p>
<p>((--Sao Paulo newsroom 5511 2485413))</p>
</text>
